{"nodes": [{"id": "openspec_changes_fix_instruct_model_auto_reply_selection_proposal_isfirstreply_ordering_defect", "label": "Cacat 1: $isFirstReply Dipakai Sebelum Didefinisikan", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/fix-instruct-model-auto-reply-selection/proposal.md", "source_location": "Current State \u2014 Cacat 1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Insert TAiPermintaan memakai inboxReplyModel($settings, $isFirstReply) pada baris 110 sedangkan $isFirstReply baru didefinisikan pada baris 123; pada PHP 8.3 variabel tersebut bernilai null sehingga selalu dievaluasi false dan kolom audit ModelAi selalu mencatat ModelAi. Model yang dikirim ke provider tetap benar \u2014 yang rusak murni jejak auditnya."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_fix_instruct_model_auto_reply_selection_proposal_provider_flag_propagation_defect", "label": "Cacat 2: Flag Tidak Diteruskan ke Provider Chat-Completions", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/fix-instruct-model-auto-reply-selection/proposal.md", "source_location": "Current State \u2014 Cacat 2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "generateReply() hanya meneruskan $isFirstReply ke cabang OpenAI; generateChatCompletionReply() punya parameter bool $isFirstReply = false yang tidak pernah diisi, sehingga instalasi DeepSeek/OpenRouter/9Router \u2014 yang justru dipilih karena biaya \u2014 tidak mendapat penghematan Model Instruct."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_fix_instruct_model_auto_reply_selection_proposal_empty_string_fallback_defect", "label": "Cacat 3: Fallback ?? Meloloskan String Kosong", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/fix-instruct-model-auto-reply-selection/proposal.md", "source_location": "Current State \u2014 Cacat 3; Proposed Changes 3-4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AiAgent::simpanPengatura